Package: PseudobulkDE
Type: Package
Title: Pseudobulk Differential Expression from Seurat Objects
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jack", "Riley", email = "jackjriley1@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Aggregates raw counts from a 'Seurat' object into pseudobulk
    samples defined by metadata columns (e.g. condition and replicate),
    optionally within each cell type, and tests for differential expression
    between two conditions using 'DESeq2' or 'edgeR'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    DESeq2,
    edgeR,
    Matrix,
    SeuratObject (>= 5.0.0),
    stats
biocViews:
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
